{"name": "SlashZero", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SlashZero is a 3D anime-style side-scrolling action roguelike game. In this game, you can unleash flashy moves, dive into thrilling combat and customize endless builds to suit your playstyle. Fight, power up, collect items and uncover the hidden truth beneath this stunning cyberpunk world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/042265f2c0da8f1a17bc0e801d62b5e1.webp?t=1785405608\" width=\"353\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master rich movesets and in-depth combat combos featuring signature aerial strings. Dash, vault, and fight across multi-layered maps for smooth, parkour-style action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/49d99e645a0198234ef8212ddffca10c.poster.avif?t=1785405608\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/49d99e645a0198234ef8212ddffca10c.webm?t=1785405608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/49d99e645a0198234ef8212ddffca10c.mp4?t=1785405608\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/c0074221e76375d7a28f2a6e59ad434c.webp?t=1785405608\" width=\"353\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel every strike with precise hit feedback. Diverse level designs keep every battle fresh and challenging. Dominate foes by blending acrobatic finesse with tactical combat strategy to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/6bacf19d0071e9cf388d28b0d55cd008.poster.avif?t=1785405608\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/6bacf19d0071e9cf388d28b0d55cd008.webm?t=1785405608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/6bacf19d0071e9cf388d28b0d55cd008.mp4?t=1785405608\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/1e0389bb70cfdecac6f8c2815b96cd04.webp?t=1785405608\" width=\"353\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out different Timehackers and find the combat playstyle that suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize hundreds of builds by wielding Authority Keys, collecting Authority Blessings and arranging Authority Codes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, you can gather intelligence in the Chamber of Secrets and earn supplies for meta progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/0468b8beadd8e778146ad3a4c8891993.poster.avif?t=1785405608\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/0468b8beadd8e778146ad3a4c8891993.webm?t=1785405608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/0468b8beadd8e778146ad3a4c8891993.mp4?t=1785405608\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/1348f972eab1ea93f687e1b30d1bc823.webp?t=1785405608\" width=\"353\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the Lord of the Void\u2014HIEROS descends, Authority Keys emerge. The scattered Keys of Causality give rise to the Null Void and the Timehackers, a resistance force formed to stand against HIEROS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a member of the Timehackers, you\u2019ll leap across divergent timelines, seek out the uncorrupted Authority Keys, unlock unimaginable power, track down HIEROS, defeat him, and save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/5f89dfee10f9da6cea56515841ee1ec0.poster.avif?t=1785405608\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/5f89dfee10f9da6cea56515841ee1ec0.webm?t=1785405608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/5f89dfee10f9da6cea56515841ee1ec0.mp4?t=1785405608\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "SlashZero is a side-scrolling action roguelike game. As a Timehacker, your job is to travel across timelines and explore a cyberpunk world, use combat skills and strategies to piece together the truth, and take down the Lord of the Void! Is what you see the truth?", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/97b0eea37021823355c84f5